ops:noteText "scroll3d series = Spanish remakes of tiktok @scroll.engineer, oldest first, voice \"scroll 2 buena español\", end tag ALTERBASE\n\nFrom 2026-10-25 the user adapts every @scroll.engineer TikTok to Spanish in the scroll3d style ([[project-scroll3d]] → styles/scroll3d/STYLE.md), oldest first, one by one. Already done: #1 Shazam (pieces/shazam), #4 compression/keyframes (pieces/compresion); also roadster, aire, escucha, tarjeta from earlier refs. #2 AirTag = pieces/airtag (started 2026-10-25). Next: #3 Google Maps traffic, #5 Face ID, #6 mouse camera, #7 Netflix, #8 Uber...\n- References download with yt-dlp into `Ref Scroll animations/` (gitignored; the old folder vanished in the iCloud move). List the account oldest-first with apify clockworks/tiktok-scraper (profileSorting \"oldest\").\n- Voice: VoiceStudio profile \"scroll 2 buena español\" (44a50a60), generated by Claude. The model clips the last syllable → generate each paragraph with a sacrificial \" Veamos.\" and cut in the pause before it (pieces/airtag/voice/gen2.py). Python with faster-whisper: ~/VoxDoc/venv/bin/python3.\n- End tag: **ALTERBASE** (user, 2026-10-25, replaced DOPAMENTES on the AirTag piece).\n- Replicate shots/camera moves, improve the animation, change some elements (place, colours, props) so it is not a copy.\n" ;
