ops:noteText "Social publishing/auto-reply stack set up 2026-10-25 — Zernio MCP (TikTok+Facebook), zernflow.com, algrow replaced by VoiceStudio\n\nSet up 2026-10-25 so Claude can publish finished videos to social networks.\n\n- Zernio MCP plugin (plugin:zernio:zernio) authenticated. Networks NOT connected yet; user will connect TikTok + Facebook (the 2 free accounts; a 3rd costs $6/mo).\n- Auto-replies: zernflow.com (hosted) with the user's Zernio API key, connection test OK. TikTok not supported there. Self-host on Vercel only if they like it.\n- Chatwoot skipped (not ManyChat-like, heavy self-host).\n- algrow: ignore (subscription lapsed); VoiceStudio replaces it.\n- open-higgsfield installed at ~/tools/open-higgsfield (`npx pnpm@10.33.0 dev`), unusable without a paid Higgsfield API balance; Google Flow stays the free generator.\n\n**Why:** user wants Claude to auto-publish generated videos and auto-reply to DMs at zero cost.\n**How to apply:** before publishing, run accounts_list; confirm platform/caption/time with the user before each post unless they say to post directly.\n" ;
ops:noteType "insight" ;
